                        "review": "Sooo... not for $13.50. This feels a little early access, and while I LOVE any couch-coop game that uses cellphones as controllers..we had technical issues with the game. Phones would lose connection and stop the games from progressing. The spacing and the games made stuff a little hard to read on a 77 inch TV. The games at times felt similar to Jackbox. Out of all the games, I think there were 2/7 that we were like.. \"FUN! AGAIN!\". The pushing game was a hit, and one of the survey games was interesting... but still flawed.. \n\nSo... I had hope for this game, but at $13, I cannot recommend. It needs some more polish to make it worth that much. Go buy any of the Jackbox Games... damn shame, cause again... love phone controller games.",
